changetrack-ng (0.7.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Enforce umask(0077) and mode 0700 private storage permissions.
  * Prevent loss of changes on VCS/diff errors with rollback and re-sequenced commit.
  * Substitute @BINDIR@ and @DEFAULTSDIR@ placeholders in packaging templates.
  * Non-blocking DNF hook execution with stderr error reporting.
  * Notifier delivery error propagation to run report warnings.
  * Lazy DNS evaluation for HOSTNAME expansion in config loader.
  * Atomic temporary-file-and-rename for revert restore operations.
  * Deduplicate Runner non-trackable file handling and consolidate VCS Base methods.
  * Modernize Subversion backend to use absolute paths without chdir.
  * Single-pass lstat and stat buffer caching in metadata processing.
  * Consolidate HTTP retry/backoff in Notify::Base.
  * Reconcile manual pages, documentation, and manifest inventory.

