changetrack-ng (0.3.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging.
  * Clean Perl rewrite of changetrack with modern VCS and notification support.
  * Supports RCS, Git, Fossil, SVN, Mercurial VCS backends.
  * Supports Email, Webhook, OTLP, and File notification channels.
  * Includes systemd timer, cron.hourly script, and apt/pacman hooks.

